    },
    {
      "text": "County parcel layer: APN 052-385-070 (300 Walnut St) owned by PBA II LLC; APN 052-385-060 (300 Walnut St) owned by Peninsula Boardwalk Associates.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Urbanize (2025-04-24) describes 16 three-story multi-unit buildings and 232 parking spaces; the city lists 17 three-story structures and 230 spaces. Both report a waiver request for garage dimensions under the State Density Bonus law and Mixed-Use Corridor-Redwood Creek zoning.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002937",
